# .xyz-pin — GH-102 seam #2 (harness release channel), Reb side.
#
# The xyz-3-agents-swarm (XYZ) harness commit this Rebalance install's XYZ
# integration is pinned to. Committed on purpose so a fresh clone is
# reproducible (Guiding Principle 10, portability) — unlike the machine-local,
# never-committed ~/.config/xyz/registry.tsv, which records the *installed*
# commit on this machine.
#
# The drift check itself (recorded-vs-installed diff, warn-on-mismatch) is
# XYZ-side: `xyz-sync check` (GH-102 Phase 1, deferred to the XYZ repo). This
# file is only the committed pin it reads; `rebalance doctor` also surfaces it.
# Update via PR only.
#
# Simple key=value lines; `#` comments and blanks ignored.
